.gitignore
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
# Materialized datasets and run outputs are large and reproducible; keep them out of git.
# ANCHORED to the repository root. Unanchored, `runs/` also matched
# `configs/runs/`, so every run configuration -- full.yaml, pilot.yaml and the
# smoke configs, i.e. the only way to actually run the benchmark -- was silently
# excluded from the repository. Same for `data/` and `configs/data*` were one to
# appear later.
/data/
/runs/
!/runs/.gitkeep
!/data/.gitkeep
.env
full_run.log

# Render output from game-world environments (DiscoveryWorld drew one PNG per
# frame per episode). 254 of these were committed once by a `git add -A`; they
# are generated, large, and belong to nothing that is read back.
video/
.history
AGENTS.md
.codex
graphify-out
outputs
prompt_export.md
_prompt_export_extract.py
_prompt_export_render.mjs
test_prompt_export.py
export_prompts.py
prompt_export_sources.json